WEBVTT

01:24.880 --> 01:30.000
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:40.920 --> 01:41.760
How's it going?

01:43.320 --> 01:45.760
It seems like he has a cold,
but I'm not sure.

01:46.280 --> 01:48.080
-Is he poisoned?
-No.

01:48.160 --> 01:49.360
What does he have?

01:49.440 --> 01:51.040
-I don't know.
-Out of the way.

01:55.840 --> 01:56.840
What are you doing here?

01:56.920 --> 01:58.880
If he doesn't take this decoction,

01:58.960 --> 02:00.480
he will not survive for two hours.

02:30.640 --> 02:32.080
Why do you have the decoction?

02:33.680 --> 02:35.840
The Cuis have a strange illness.

02:36.360 --> 02:39.480
The onset time is different
depending on the constitution.

02:39.560 --> 02:41.400
I know how to make it.

02:41.480 --> 02:43.320
I've never heard of it.

02:43.400 --> 02:44.720
It's the Cui family's secret.

02:46.080 --> 02:47.520
We don't tell outsiders.

02:49.200 --> 02:50.120
Well,

02:50.200 --> 02:52.720
only I know the recipe for this decoction.

02:53.240 --> 02:55.880
Besides, I am the principal of Wuling.

02:56.400 --> 02:57.680
You have to listen to me.

03:12.000 --> 03:15.480
Master Shijiu,
do the Cuis have this weird illness?

03:22.200 --> 03:23.760
My father mentioned it to me before.

03:24.280 --> 03:26.440
Master Eight is allergic to lantanas.

03:26.520 --> 03:28.720
Once he touches it,
he develops the symptoms of a cold,

03:28.800 --> 03:30.440
wheezing and fainting.

03:30.960 --> 03:33.680
You asked me to find this flower
as soon as we arrived at Wuling.

03:33.760 --> 03:35.600
You had a plan then.

03:37.600 --> 03:39.080
You're brilliant.

03:39.600 --> 03:41.920
You and the other stewards
were fine after drinking this wine.

03:42.000 --> 03:45.680
Only Master Eight is sick.
They couldn't find anything.

03:47.320 --> 03:49.320
Fortunately, Master Eight recognized

03:49.400 --> 03:50.920
the family head's token in front of them.

03:51.480 --> 03:53.160
Otherwise, it's all for nothing.

03:56.560 --> 03:58.360
Wuling is dangerous.

03:58.880 --> 04:01.440
Only with the ownership of the mine
and the family head's token

04:01.520 --> 04:03.200
can I convince them.

04:05.000 --> 04:07.560
-We should tread lightly.
-Yes.

04:07.640 --> 04:10.680
About Heishan,
he's not a man to be trifled with.

04:10.760 --> 04:12.640
Heishan is easy to deal with.

04:13.160 --> 04:14.880
He's loyal to Master Eight.

04:16.560 --> 04:18.920
Besides, Master Eight's life
is in our hands.

04:19.000 --> 04:20.200
He doesn't dare to do anything.

04:24.360 --> 04:28.160
Every steward in Wuling
is not easy to deal with.

04:30.760 --> 04:33.080
We must get the mine title deed
as soon as possible.

04:36.400 --> 04:38.440
Caning was too good for you.

04:38.520 --> 04:40.040
When we get to Wuling,

04:40.120 --> 04:42.440
-you should make amends.
-Okay.

04:42.520 --> 04:44.400
I'll listen to you.

04:44.480 --> 04:47.760
I'll do whatever you want me to do.

04:54.520 --> 04:56.640
Come on. Come on.

05:00.320 --> 05:01.760
Put this on top.

05:02.400 --> 05:03.560
Go.

05:04.080 --> 05:05.000
Put it there.

05:07.560 --> 05:08.400
Duanwu.

05:09.520 --> 05:10.640
What's wrong?

05:10.720 --> 05:13.520
We're not going with the trading convoy.

05:14.120 --> 05:16.560
The Master said the trading convoy
was going to the west.

05:16.640 --> 05:18.800
The return date was uncertain.

05:19.320 --> 05:21.960
And we just told him we were homesick.

05:22.760 --> 05:23.800
We…

05:24.560 --> 05:25.600
We're homesick.

05:25.680 --> 05:27.040
Don't worry.

05:27.560 --> 05:29.400
The Master gave us a lot of money.

05:29.480 --> 05:31.200
When we return to our hometown,
we can buy a dowry

05:31.840 --> 05:33.360
and marry good men.

05:37.200 --> 05:38.040
Okay.

05:40.000 --> 05:41.720
It's better to live a peaceful life
in the countryside

05:42.360 --> 05:45.200
than live a life of fear
in the trading convoy.

05:45.280 --> 05:48.800
Thank you for taking care of me
all this time.

05:48.880 --> 05:50.480
I wish you

05:51.000 --> 05:54.120
all the best.

05:55.200 --> 05:56.120
Take care of yourself.

05:57.720 --> 05:59.200
Take care.

06:02.480 --> 06:05.280
All right, just go. Just go.

06:05.360 --> 06:08.200
Hit the road.
You won't be able to go if it's too late.

06:09.200 --> 06:10.040
Let's go.

06:24.640 --> 06:25.480
Are you homesick?

06:29.560 --> 06:32.040
Home is where you are.

06:32.640 --> 06:33.480
Duanwu.

06:35.360 --> 06:38.120
-I'm not leaving.
-You…

06:38.640 --> 06:42.200
-You can speak.
-I'm all right.

06:57.920 --> 06:59.480
Are the carriages loaded?

07:08.440 --> 07:09.280
Yes.

07:12.960 --> 07:13.800
Let's go.

07:21.400 --> 07:22.440
I'll go first.

07:39.600 --> 07:41.400
My sleeves are fragrant.

07:42.000 --> 07:44.160
I can't send the flower
to my lover far away.

07:45.840 --> 07:47.600
The flower is not rare.

07:49.040 --> 07:51.440
I just want to use this flower
to express my sorrow.

07:56.160 --> 07:59.880
Forget it. She left early in the morning.
She didn't say goodbye to you.

08:03.080 --> 08:05.200
It's all right. We'll catch up with them.

08:05.280 --> 08:06.800
Are you worried about her?

08:09.760 --> 08:10.840
Sort of.

08:11.440 --> 08:13.800
From the Cui's Pearl Farm
to the Yue family of Shaozhou,

08:14.760 --> 08:16.280
he never miscalculated.

08:17.640 --> 08:20.040
It was as if he were weaving a huge net,

08:21.080 --> 08:23.520
driving his prey into a corner,

08:23.600 --> 08:25.120
and hanging them in it.

08:27.720 --> 08:29.400
Who is his next prey?

08:30.160 --> 08:32.919
-You mean Yan Zijing?
-What do you think?

08:35.440 --> 08:36.600
I don't think so.

08:37.960 --> 08:39.919
Then, you should eat more
to replenish your brain.

09:22.920 --> 09:24.720
Don't add tea leaves
until the water is boiling.

09:24.800 --> 09:26.440
Don't add tea leaves
until the water is boiling…

09:30.280 --> 09:31.120
Okay.

09:35.560 --> 09:38.080
Don't drink the first boiling water.
Pour it out.

09:39.240 --> 09:42.920
Don't drink the first boiling water.
Pour it out. Pour it out.

09:56.800 --> 09:57.720
Don't drink the second boiling water.

09:58.560 --> 10:00.160
Pour it into a boiled water vessel.

10:05.040 --> 10:06.240
When the tea blends with water

10:07.000 --> 10:09.520
and the water is boiling,
it is the third boiling.

10:10.040 --> 10:11.360
-It is ready.
-The water is boiling.

10:14.120 --> 10:16.480
-Third boiling.
-Wait.

10:16.560 --> 10:18.800
Wash the teaware
with the second boiling water.

10:23.840 --> 10:25.600
-Is there anything wrong?
-No.

10:46.920 --> 10:48.320
Master.

10:54.520 --> 10:56.320
I didn't know

10:56.840 --> 10:58.560
you were so picky.

10:58.640 --> 11:02.080
It's a long way.
I don't have anything to do.

11:05.600 --> 11:07.800
You don't have anything to do. Is that why

11:09.880 --> 11:11.760
-you're teasing me?
-I'm not teasing you.

11:11.840 --> 11:12.720
I'm teaching you how to make tea.

11:13.320 --> 11:16.960
It would have been perfect
if you had baked the tea cake before.

11:17.640 --> 11:18.880
I learned to make tea,

11:19.480 --> 11:23.000
but what I want to learn
is jewelry, business,

11:23.080 --> 11:24.000
or…

11:25.320 --> 11:26.720
Anyway, I don't want to learn to make tea.

11:26.800 --> 11:29.120
I told you I would teach you.

11:29.200 --> 11:32.920
You should learn how to make tea first.

11:33.000 --> 11:36.080
I told you.
You didn't bake the tea cake. Start over.

11:43.200 --> 11:46.600
Why don't you drink this pot first?

11:46.680 --> 11:49.560
The tea is precious. Don't waste it.

11:52.640 --> 11:54.480
-You have a cup.
-I'll pass.

11:55.040 --> 11:55.880
It's too precious.

11:59.800 --> 12:00.640
Master, please.

12:07.800 --> 12:08.880
Master, please.

12:17.800 --> 12:18.640
Master, please.

12:25.600 --> 12:27.440
-Master, please.
-You…

12:27.520 --> 12:29.840
It's good tea. You should drink more.

12:34.320 --> 12:37.320
Duanwu has been in the Master's carriage
for a long time.

12:40.480 --> 12:42.520
Maybe Master Yan wants to talk to her.

12:42.600 --> 12:44.480
What are you worried about?

12:45.480 --> 12:49.000
Shiqi, you don't know. I'm worried

12:49.520 --> 12:52.600
Master is plotting against Duanwu.

12:55.440 --> 12:56.760
Why are you laughing?

12:57.680 --> 12:59.480
Master Yan is not that kind of person.

12:59.560 --> 13:03.680
I'm afraid they'll fall in love
with each other.

13:05.240 --> 13:06.280
Fall in love?

13:07.040 --> 13:09.000
Who fell in love with whom?

13:09.720 --> 13:10.680
All right.

13:11.800 --> 13:13.200
Don't pry.

13:16.040 --> 13:17.640
All right. I'll tell you.

13:18.480 --> 13:20.640
The Master fell in love with Duanwu.

13:22.240 --> 13:24.360
Maybe Duanwu fell in love with the Master.

13:25.520 --> 13:27.520
That's what I'm worried about.

13:29.560 --> 13:33.720
If they love each other,
isn't it a good thing?

13:33.800 --> 13:36.440
They don't fit.

13:37.480 --> 13:39.800
Mr. Zhang and Duanwu fit.

13:41.600 --> 13:44.480
-Why?
-The Master treats Duanwu badly.

13:45.120 --> 13:47.160
But Mr. Zhang is completely different.

13:47.240 --> 13:49.600
He's educated, reasonable, and tender.

13:49.680 --> 13:52.120
Most importantly, he's nice to Duanwu.

13:52.640 --> 13:54.680
Mr. Zhang is the best for Duanwu.

13:56.920 --> 14:00.240
Is the right person the best?

14:03.560 --> 14:05.560
Love me tender.

14:06.080 --> 14:07.880
Love me long.

14:08.840 --> 14:10.600
It's important that they love each other.

14:11.560 --> 14:13.520
It's important if they fit.

14:14.040 --> 14:16.880
Don't fall in love with the wrong person.

14:17.440 --> 14:19.840
Love with the right person lasts.

14:20.360 --> 14:21.440
It's aurin.

14:21.520 --> 14:22.480
It's native to Kuran.

14:22.560 --> 14:24.720
A delicate texture
without cracks is preferred.

14:24.800 --> 14:26.280
Aurin.

14:26.360 --> 14:29.400
This one is called fire bead.
Many dignitaries like it.

14:29.480 --> 14:32.880
The gentiles would tribute it
to the imperial court.

14:34.680 --> 14:35.520
Fire bead.

14:37.200 --> 14:38.080
This one.

14:38.600 --> 14:39.840
This one is called emerald.

14:40.360 --> 14:44.040
It has a long history,
but very few people know about it.

14:46.840 --> 14:49.040
-Emerald.
-Yes.

14:51.400 --> 14:54.880
It's so clear. And it's deep green.

14:55.400 --> 14:58.760
It gives me a bottomless feeling.

15:01.760 --> 15:02.640
Master.

15:03.920 --> 15:05.400
Emeralds are similar to you.

15:11.720 --> 15:12.560
What is this?

15:13.880 --> 15:15.640
It's a moonstone.

15:17.640 --> 15:20.320
It's clearer.

15:21.240 --> 15:23.640
It's bright. A gentleman is like the moon.

15:24.160 --> 15:26.040
The moonstone

15:27.720 --> 15:29.400
is more like…

15:31.000 --> 15:32.320
Lady Shiqi.

15:34.000 --> 15:35.400
It's also similar to Mr. Zhang.

15:37.400 --> 15:38.320
They are like it.

15:43.120 --> 15:47.200
The moonstone goes well with the emerald.

15:48.720 --> 15:49.680
I don't think so.

15:52.240 --> 15:53.480
You're right.

15:54.160 --> 15:55.640
The emerald is too eye-catching.

15:55.720 --> 15:59.320
It makes the moonstone look unremarkable.

16:01.920 --> 16:03.440
What about this?

16:04.120 --> 16:06.480
If you use a Nanyang pearl
with a moonstone…

16:10.240 --> 16:11.240
They don't fit.

16:11.320 --> 16:13.400
What do you mean by that?

16:13.480 --> 16:15.880
One is from the deep sea.
The other one is from the mountains.

16:15.960 --> 16:17.440
They don't go well together.

16:17.520 --> 16:20.040
-Is there such a thing?
-Of course.

16:20.680 --> 16:24.000
Western Regions colored stones
don't go well with Central Plains jewelry.

16:24.640 --> 16:25.640
Look.

16:26.160 --> 16:28.360
The Nanyang pearl and the moonstone

16:28.440 --> 16:30.080
are pure.

16:30.160 --> 16:33.600
They complement each other

16:33.680 --> 16:35.960
and go well together.

16:36.040 --> 16:38.920
It has a hazy feeling.

16:39.720 --> 16:40.920
It's nice.

16:43.160 --> 16:47.320
In that case, why don't you use
an emerald with a pearl?

16:49.720 --> 16:50.720
It's even better.

16:51.600 --> 16:52.640
Better?

16:53.360 --> 16:56.960
It's more eye-catching.
They set each other off very well.

17:00.520 --> 17:03.800
In that case, I'll give you an assignment.

17:03.880 --> 17:07.359
Make an ornament
with emeralds and Nanyang pearls

17:07.440 --> 17:08.280
and bring it to me tomorrow.

17:16.119 --> 17:17.240
Pearl.

17:18.040 --> 17:20.800
-Aurin.
-Well, ask Kang Ju to stop.

17:20.880 --> 17:22.720
We're camping here tonight.

17:26.160 --> 17:27.400
-Do it.
-Okay.

17:28.079 --> 17:30.280
-Supervisor Kang.
-Yes.

17:30.800 --> 17:33.360
The Master wants to go to the toilet.
We're camping here tonight.

17:33.440 --> 17:34.840
Okay.

17:35.440 --> 17:36.520
You did it on purpose, didn't you?

17:40.320 --> 17:41.240
Do you want more tea?

17:42.360 --> 17:43.480
I'll make it for you.

17:56.600 --> 17:57.560
-Put it in that tent.
-Okay.

17:58.560 --> 17:59.760
-Move this over.
-Okay.

17:59.840 --> 18:01.320
Hurry up.

18:20.680 --> 18:22.960
-Mr. Zhang.
-Duanwu.

18:24.280 --> 18:27.800
I didn't have time
to say goodbye to you in Shaozhou.

18:28.520 --> 18:32.160
I didn't expect to meet you here.
Are you going back to Chang'an?

18:32.960 --> 18:33.920
No.

18:34.440 --> 18:36.440
I'm going to travel around.
I don't have a destination in mind.

18:37.040 --> 18:38.280
Travel around.

18:39.040 --> 18:39.960
Where are you going?

18:40.040 --> 18:42.880
-We're going to Wuling.
-Wuling?

18:43.800 --> 18:47.160
Wuling is a great place.
Maybe I'll go there.

18:47.760 --> 18:49.360
Mr. Zhang, are you interested in Wuling?

18:50.760 --> 18:53.000
I'm traveling around.
I'll go wherever I want.

18:53.520 --> 18:56.720
It's a big world, but we met here.

18:57.640 --> 19:00.880
Duanwu.
We have a connection with Mr. Zhang.

19:04.880 --> 19:07.320
Mr. Zhang, are you leaving later?

19:07.400 --> 19:08.560
Of course not.

19:09.080 --> 19:11.800
Since you're also going to Wuling,
we can go together.

19:14.640 --> 19:16.400
Would you like

19:16.480 --> 19:19.200
to have some wild foods
with Duanwu and me tonight?

19:20.280 --> 19:21.120
Okay.

19:24.560 --> 19:26.760
Supervisor Kang, awesome.
You didn't miss a shot.

19:30.320 --> 19:33.240
Mr. Zhang, do you want to give it a try?

19:38.760 --> 19:39.960
Take this one.

20:02.240 --> 20:03.240
You got it.

20:03.320 --> 20:05.640
Mr. Du, you're awesome, too.

20:06.840 --> 20:07.920
It's easy.

20:09.720 --> 20:12.880
Duanwu, you told me
you wanted to learn archery.

20:13.400 --> 20:14.520
I'll teach you today.

20:16.160 --> 20:18.800
-Is that okay?
-Try it yourself.

20:39.920 --> 20:41.560
Shrimp, how about it?

20:41.640 --> 20:43.880
Duanwu, you were so close.

20:43.960 --> 20:47.280
-That chicken was running fast.
-Come on.

20:48.640 --> 20:51.320
You don't have enough strength
if you don't want to kill it.

20:51.400 --> 20:52.240
I'll teach you.

20:52.960 --> 20:55.640
Hold it up. Straighten your arm.

21:01.440 --> 21:04.560
Raise your elbow. Pull the string.

21:05.920 --> 21:06.760
Okay.

21:12.680 --> 21:13.680
Aim at the prey.

21:17.280 --> 21:18.440
Do you see it?

21:22.400 --> 21:23.800
Duanwu, you got it.

21:24.400 --> 21:25.680
Duanwu, awesome.

21:25.760 --> 21:27.160
Let me see.

21:27.760 --> 21:30.520
Duanwu, we have a lot of chickens
to eat tonight.

21:31.120 --> 21:33.120
You don't have to show your teeth

21:33.720 --> 21:34.760
in everything.

21:35.880 --> 21:37.760
It's only about archery.

21:38.840 --> 21:42.800
Mr. Zhang, I hope
you'll do your own thing.

21:43.520 --> 21:46.560
I hope you'll work for the people

21:46.640 --> 21:49.840
and punish injustice.

21:50.360 --> 21:52.680
-That's what you should do.
-Of course.

21:53.520 --> 21:55.000
I'll do it.

21:56.680 --> 21:57.840
That would be the best.

22:04.720 --> 22:05.840
Duanwu.

22:06.360 --> 22:07.520
-You're fetching water.
-Mr. Zhang.

22:08.040 --> 22:09.920
-Let me help you.
-No need.

22:10.000 --> 22:11.280
-Let me.
-Let me help you.

22:11.360 --> 22:12.560
I'm almost done.

22:13.520 --> 22:14.360
Okay.

22:16.560 --> 22:18.120
I have some good news for you.

22:19.400 --> 22:21.440
The Cui family was ordered
to pay a high amount of compensation.

22:21.520 --> 22:23.160
They can't turn the situation around.

22:28.440 --> 22:31.840
They deserve it. This is good news.

22:32.720 --> 22:33.960
Thank you, Mr. Zhang.

22:40.520 --> 22:44.560
-I thought of a story today.
-What story?

22:44.640 --> 22:47.360
-Would you like to hear it?
-Okay.

22:50.400 --> 22:52.160
Once upon a time, there was a scholar.

22:52.240 --> 22:55.520
He traveled by boat,
but he encountered a storm.

22:56.280 --> 22:59.200
Fortunately, he was saved
by a beautiful mermaid.

23:01.240 --> 23:02.440
From then on,

23:03.640 --> 23:06.920
the scholar told the mermaid stories
about the world.

23:07.440 --> 23:11.280
The mermaid
told the scholar stories about the sea.

23:12.200 --> 23:15.160
They fell in love at first sight.

23:20.480 --> 23:23.160
But the mermaid couldn't leave the sea.

23:24.040 --> 23:26.000
The scholar couldn't live at sea.

23:27.520 --> 23:28.760
The sea separated them.

23:31.760 --> 23:35.360
From then on, the scholar
looked everywhere for medicine

23:36.120 --> 23:38.080
that would make the mermaid grow legs.

23:39.400 --> 23:41.120
He wanted to be with her forever.

23:48.600 --> 23:49.440
Done.

23:51.840 --> 23:54.600
Mr. Zhang, why do you think
it's a sad story?

23:55.280 --> 23:56.680
I don't think so.

23:58.040 --> 23:59.960
The mermaid couldn't leave the sea.

24:00.040 --> 24:02.400
The scholar couldn't live at the sea.

24:03.440 --> 24:04.360
Why would they force it?

24:05.720 --> 24:08.720
In that case, their meeting was a mistake.

24:10.280 --> 24:13.080
I don't feel sad, but regretful.

24:15.360 --> 24:16.200
Besides,

24:16.720 --> 24:19.760
the scholar wanted the mermaid
to grow legs,

24:19.840 --> 24:21.120
but he didn't think

24:21.200 --> 24:24.120
about finding the medicine
to turn himself into a merman.

24:26.360 --> 24:27.440
It's a pity.

24:28.920 --> 24:29.760
Let's go.

24:32.440 --> 24:34.800
-Go.
-Duanwu.

24:36.560 --> 24:38.680
What if the scholar
wanted to become a merman?

24:54.040 --> 24:55.160
Mr. Zhang.

24:56.680 --> 24:58.280
Life is not a story.

24:59.480 --> 25:01.680
There is no such medicine in the world.

25:03.200 --> 25:04.040
Right?

25:05.520 --> 25:06.360
Yes.

25:09.440 --> 25:11.920
-Let's go.
-I'll get water.

25:18.600 --> 25:20.000
I'll go first.

25:33.480 --> 25:36.480
Are you happy? What are you doing here?

25:38.640 --> 25:40.800
There's no meat in your meal.

25:41.560 --> 25:44.680
I got some for you. Eat it.

25:45.880 --> 25:50.280
You're ungrateful. You had a good time.

25:50.360 --> 25:54.680
You've been sitting on a cushion
in a carriage these days.

25:54.760 --> 25:56.080
What about me?

25:56.160 --> 25:59.520
I've been sitting in a trailer.
It was bumpy.

25:59.600 --> 26:03.520
I… I'm falling apart.

26:03.600 --> 26:05.480
How could you face me?

26:06.120 --> 26:08.880
Are you going to comfort me
with a few pieces of meat?

26:13.520 --> 26:17.800
I never did anything wrong to you
or to the Yue family.

26:20.800 --> 26:22.120
You should

26:24.320 --> 26:25.880
blame yourself for all this.

26:26.480 --> 26:28.840
What? I should blame myslef?

26:29.440 --> 26:31.040
I worked hard

26:31.120 --> 26:33.760
just to get you to marry a good man.

26:33.840 --> 26:35.640
Did I do anything wrong?

26:36.320 --> 26:38.840
Look at you. You joined them

26:38.920 --> 26:40.560
in bullying me.

26:40.640 --> 26:43.280
You wanted to sell me.

26:43.360 --> 26:46.080
You didn't do it for me
but for the Yue family.

26:46.160 --> 26:48.400
What was wrong with that?

26:49.120 --> 26:53.040
Think about it. Where did I get the money

26:53.120 --> 26:54.880
to spoil you?

26:55.400 --> 26:57.880
It was all from the Yue family.

26:58.400 --> 26:59.800
You should return the favor.

27:00.400 --> 27:01.840
Have you thought about me?

27:06.720 --> 27:09.800
I am human, not a product.

27:10.840 --> 27:13.640
Should I be sold just because I'm a girl?

27:16.320 --> 27:17.840
Let me ask you.

27:17.920 --> 27:21.160
What am I to you?

27:23.360 --> 27:26.600
You wanted to cut off my hand for money.

27:27.680 --> 27:29.680
I didn't want to bring it up.

27:30.800 --> 27:33.400
You knew I had no other pursuit in my life

27:33.480 --> 27:35.480
than to carve jade.

27:36.080 --> 27:38.840
You even wanted to take it from me.

27:41.640 --> 27:45.160
-Don't talk about gratitude.
-You…

27:47.840 --> 27:48.840
Hey.

27:49.520 --> 27:50.720
How dare you!

27:50.800 --> 27:53.360
I'm your father.
How could you talk to me like that?

27:54.520 --> 27:55.760
If it weren't for me,

27:55.840 --> 27:59.320
you would have been thrown into a well
and drowned.

28:04.480 --> 28:05.360
I…

28:07.040 --> 28:09.720
I'd rather drown
than have a father like you.

28:10.800 --> 28:12.800
You… You…

28:12.880 --> 28:15.920
You… You…

28:34.720 --> 28:36.400
Shrimp, does it smell good?

28:36.480 --> 28:37.800
Smell it.

28:39.800 --> 28:41.040
It smells great.

28:41.120 --> 28:42.640
You have the first bite
when it's done, okay?

28:42.720 --> 28:44.520
-Supervisor Kang.
-That's very nice of you.

28:49.040 --> 28:51.520
-Shrimp, do you want a flatbread?
-Okay.

28:52.880 --> 28:54.680
-You didn't put it in.
-It tastes good.

28:54.760 --> 28:55.880
-Who's there?
-Stop it.

28:56.440 --> 28:57.560
Come out.

29:11.680 --> 29:13.560
He looks like…

29:15.160 --> 29:16.040
Cao Da.

29:19.520 --> 29:20.880
It's me.

29:22.520 --> 29:24.360
I saw you in the morning,

29:24.440 --> 29:27.480
but I couldn't believe my eyes.

29:28.000 --> 29:30.600
I see you again.

29:30.680 --> 29:33.240
Why do you look like this?
What are you doing here?

29:36.080 --> 29:40.320
After I was kicked off the boat,
I didn't know where to go.

29:40.400 --> 29:43.000
I walked here.

29:43.560 --> 29:45.200
Then, I met you.

29:45.280 --> 29:48.440
Master, it was my fault

29:48.520 --> 29:51.200
for betraying the trading convoy.

29:51.280 --> 29:55.440
-I was wrong.
-Hey.

29:55.520 --> 29:57.160
I was wrong.

29:57.840 --> 29:59.560
Please forgive me.

30:00.760 --> 30:03.360
The book says

30:03.440 --> 30:06.880
it's better late than none.

30:07.840 --> 30:09.280
It's, "It's better late than never."

30:09.360 --> 30:11.720
Yeah, it's better late than never.

30:12.360 --> 30:13.840
Please give me a chance.

30:13.920 --> 30:15.640
I'll do whatever you want.

30:15.720 --> 30:19.120
I can do everything.

30:19.200 --> 30:22.000
I was promoted

30:22.080 --> 30:24.760
because of my strength.

30:27.280 --> 30:30.840
Duanwu, you punished him.

30:31.400 --> 30:33.640
You decide whether to let him stay or not.

30:35.080 --> 30:38.040
-Master, I…
-Duanwu.

30:38.640 --> 30:40.320
I know you are cold on the outside,

30:40.400 --> 30:42.520
but you are kind on the inside.

30:43.320 --> 30:44.920
Duanwu, you're kind.

30:45.560 --> 30:48.200
I broke your trust.

30:49.160 --> 30:51.680
-No. Pang Song broke your trust.
-What?

30:51.760 --> 30:54.440
No. It's all my fault.

30:54.520 --> 30:57.360
I'm at your disposal. I'm begging you.

30:57.440 --> 30:59.920
-Please let me stay.
-Wait.

31:00.000 --> 31:01.160
Get up. Don't do that
in front of so many people.

31:01.920 --> 31:03.960
-Are you willing to do anything?
-Yes.

31:05.480 --> 31:07.560
Are you willing to start at the bottom?

31:08.720 --> 31:10.080
Yes.

31:16.080 --> 31:17.800
Here's a chicken leg.

31:17.880 --> 31:19.280
Eat a chicken leg first.

31:19.880 --> 31:21.160
We'll roast chicken feet for you later.

31:21.240 --> 31:23.800
Come on.

31:44.120 --> 31:46.200
Duanwu, thank you.

31:48.120 --> 31:50.320
Let's go eat chicken feet.

31:50.400 --> 31:52.560
-This chicken leg is a little burnt.
-You forgave him?

31:52.640 --> 31:54.160
Eat it or not?

31:54.240 --> 31:55.800
If you won’t eat, I will!

31:55.880 --> 31:57.560
You taught me that.

31:58.080 --> 32:00.360
Make the best use of things and men.

32:00.440 --> 32:03.040
That's it.
Our trading convoy is short of hands.

32:03.120 --> 32:05.720
Why don't we let Cao Da stay?
It's good for all of us.

32:37.600 --> 32:40.200
Mr. Zhang,
I've been looking all over for you.

32:40.720 --> 32:42.360
The meat is ready. Let's go eat.

32:47.200 --> 32:48.800
Why bother?

32:49.640 --> 32:51.480
It's not going to work out
with you and her.

32:52.120 --> 32:56.120
Your future wife
will be a daughter of a good family.

32:56.200 --> 32:57.760
If you marry her,

32:57.840 --> 32:59.640
you have to go against your whole family.

33:00.440 --> 33:01.440
Are you willing to marry her

33:02.240 --> 33:03.080
as a concubine?

33:06.040 --> 33:07.680
That's the reality.

33:08.280 --> 33:09.360
Let's go back to Chang'an tomorrow.

33:12.800 --> 33:13.720
We're going to Wuling.

33:16.880 --> 33:19.080
There must have been something wrong
with the national gift.

33:26.280 --> 33:28.000
Yunxiu, here.

33:28.680 --> 33:29.520
Be careful.

33:30.360 --> 33:31.680
Mr. Zhang, have one.

33:31.760 --> 33:34.680
Yeah. Have a taste. I made it.

33:34.760 --> 33:35.600
It's delicious.

33:41.800 --> 33:43.400
I'll have one, too.

33:44.000 --> 33:46.280
Duanwu. Duanwu.

33:47.520 --> 33:48.560
It's burnt.

33:50.560 --> 33:52.480
-It's all right.
-Here.

33:53.240 --> 33:54.600
-Eat mine.
-Eat mine.

34:09.120 --> 34:12.719
I roasted these chicken feet for Cao Da.

34:14.960 --> 34:16.719
Cao Da, eat chicken feet.

34:17.320 --> 34:18.159
Okay.

34:21.920 --> 34:22.760
Come on.

34:23.560 --> 34:24.679
Thank you, leader.

34:24.760 --> 34:27.480
Just eat mine.

34:27.560 --> 34:28.800
Thank you, Master.

34:29.719 --> 34:32.760
-Eat a flatbread with it.
-Okay.

34:36.560 --> 34:37.400
Give me some.

34:42.800 --> 34:45.320
Mr. Zhang,
I heard you went to fetch water today,

34:45.840 --> 34:48.760
but you got nothing.

34:50.679 --> 34:53.080
You came first

34:54.040 --> 34:55.239
but were not served.

34:57.440 --> 34:59.160
Maybe you're in the wrong place.

35:08.280 --> 35:11.920
Leader, I'm happy to be back
in the trading convoy.

35:12.000 --> 35:13.400
Let me dance for you.

35:13.480 --> 35:14.720
Okay, I'll dance with you.

35:15.320 --> 35:17.360
-Come on.
-Count me in.

35:18.600 --> 35:19.600
Hey.

36:17.080 --> 36:19.400
It's time to go again.

36:19.480 --> 36:23.080
If there's still a bumpy road ahead,
my butt can't stand it anymore.

36:23.160 --> 36:26.200
My body is falling apart.

36:31.320 --> 36:33.160
-Hurry up, guys.
-Okay.

36:33.680 --> 36:35.480
-Come on.
-Hurry up.

36:35.560 --> 36:36.400
Come on.

36:37.240 --> 36:40.120
-Master Yan.
-What is it?

36:41.320 --> 36:45.160
Could you take care of my father?

36:45.680 --> 36:48.720
He just got caned.
He can't stand the bumps.

36:49.600 --> 36:50.680
Don't you hate him?

37:01.560 --> 37:03.120
He raised me.

37:06.280 --> 37:07.240
All right.

37:08.200 --> 37:09.600
I'll get him a carriage.

37:11.280 --> 37:12.840
Thank you, Master Yan.

37:13.880 --> 37:17.040
This is for you.

37:23.320 --> 37:25.440
I think you should take it back.

37:27.640 --> 37:28.520
Thank you.

37:31.280 --> 37:34.080
-I'll go back.
-Okay.

37:41.720 --> 37:44.120
-Master.
-What?

37:44.800 --> 37:47.840
Everything is almost packed.
We'll be ready to go in a minute.

37:48.440 --> 37:49.280
Okay.

37:49.360 --> 37:52.040
I told Yunxiu what happened in Shaozhou

37:52.720 --> 37:54.240
and in the Yue's mansion.

37:54.960 --> 37:56.640
Thank you for taking her with us.

37:56.720 --> 37:58.560
You've thanked me for that.

37:59.640 --> 38:02.680
If it weren't for me,

38:03.320 --> 38:04.720
she wouldn't have gone through this.

38:04.800 --> 38:06.480
If it weren't for you,

38:07.720 --> 38:09.440
her hands would be broken.

38:10.360 --> 38:11.840
If it weren't for you,

38:13.080 --> 38:14.960
she would have been sold.

38:17.160 --> 38:19.560
You saved her.

38:20.480 --> 38:22.240
She will have new hope

38:23.120 --> 38:24.840
with us.

38:28.280 --> 38:29.480
I hope so.

38:49.600 --> 38:50.520
What kind of dance is that?

38:52.240 --> 38:53.640
-It is…
-It's the hand-waving dance.

38:54.160 --> 38:56.600
It is to drive away evil spirits,

38:56.680 --> 38:58.920
-diseases, and plagues.
-Hand-waving dance…

39:08.240 --> 39:12.080
It means
that they are praying for someone.

39:12.920 --> 39:16.360
That's right. Looks like someone
in the Bafang Tower is sick.

39:16.440 --> 39:18.600
He should be a big shot.

39:19.640 --> 39:22.640
If I'm right, it should be Master Eight.

39:23.520 --> 39:26.000
Look. They are giving away porridge.

39:27.360 --> 39:29.320
Master Eight is a good man.

39:30.080 --> 39:32.000
Master Eight
is a member of the Cui family.

39:32.520 --> 39:35.000
Wuling is famous for the Wuling Quarry.

39:35.080 --> 39:38.360
The Wuling Mines was created
by the old master of the Cui family.

39:38.880 --> 39:40.880
Then, it was handed over
to the Cui's eighth son,

39:41.400 --> 39:42.560
that is Master Eight.

39:42.640 --> 39:44.920
Mr. Zhang, you know a lot.

39:45.000 --> 39:46.760
I'm not as good as you.

39:47.920 --> 39:48.920
I'm a businessman.

39:49.440 --> 39:53.160
All I know is that someone owes me money,
and I have to ask for it.

39:55.040 --> 39:55.880
Go.

40:03.840 --> 40:05.520
We can't follow his lead.

40:07.720 --> 40:09.600
He's waiting for us
to make the first move.

40:10.120 --> 40:11.800
But this is not the time.

40:13.040 --> 40:13.920
Here.

40:14.000 --> 40:17.760
-Thank you.
-Stay close.

40:19.720 --> 40:20.600
Thank you.

40:20.680 --> 40:22.640
Get away. Get in line.

40:23.680 --> 40:24.920
Come here, Yunxiu.

40:25.440 --> 40:26.440
Don't walk around.

40:30.120 --> 40:31.960
This is different from the rumors.

40:36.840 --> 40:38.080
-Next one.
-Loud,

40:38.160 --> 40:39.720
-keep an eye on him.
-Why is this porridge so thin?

40:39.800 --> 40:42.320
-Can't you give me more?
-Shut up.

40:42.400 --> 40:44.800
-Leader, that guy is weird.
-Next one.

40:44.880 --> 40:46.120
I'll check it out.

40:50.480 --> 40:51.440
Go.

40:53.080 --> 40:53.960
Duanwu.

40:54.640 --> 40:56.240
Where are you going to stay?

40:56.840 --> 40:58.840
-We…
-We'll stay at the Bafang Tower.

40:58.920 --> 41:02.600
Mr. Yan, it would be amazing
if you could stay at the Bafang Tower.

41:05.000 --> 41:07.000
Mr. Yan, don't worry.

41:07.080 --> 41:08.880
With my relationship with Master Eight,

41:08.960 --> 41:11.440
we can stay at the Bafang Tower.

41:12.080 --> 41:13.600
Thank you, Master Yue.

41:14.560 --> 41:16.840
Mr. Zhang, because of your identity,

41:16.920 --> 41:18.320
you can't stay at the Bafang Tower.

41:18.840 --> 41:21.680
You'd better find an official inn.

41:21.760 --> 41:23.400
Don't worry about me.

41:29.800 --> 41:31.240
-Get in line.
-Duanwu.

41:32.640 --> 41:33.840
Take care.

41:33.920 --> 41:34.880
Next one.

41:35.400 --> 41:37.000
Mr. Zhang, take care.

41:54.160 --> 41:56.160
-Keep an eye on the Bafang Tower.
-Yes.

41:58.320 --> 41:59.240
Go.

42:04.960 --> 42:05.960
I'll do it.

42:06.040 --> 42:08.280
-Can you do it?
-Again.

42:15.400 --> 42:16.240
Come on.

42:20.280 --> 42:21.320
Come on.

42:31.080 --> 42:33.440
It's okay. That's what they do.

42:33.520 --> 42:36.080
When Master Eight sees me, I promise…

42:38.400 --> 42:41.360
-Wei Yan, settle them down.
-Yes.

42:45.560 --> 42:46.400
Be careful.

42:49.240 --> 42:50.080
Kang Ju.

42:51.120 --> 42:52.840
Come with me to meet Master Eight.

42:53.600 --> 42:54.760
Please.
